Third-party data — NOT covered by the licence above
---------------------------------------------------

This repository redistributes derived extracts of openly licensed datasets. Each remains
under its own licence, and attribution for them belongs to their providers:

  OpenStreetMap cultivated-land features and mapping-coverage counts
      © OpenStreetMap contributors — Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0
      https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

  GADM v4.1 administrative boundaries
      GADM — CC BY 4.0
      https://gadm.org/license.html

  NASA POWER agro-climate data
      NASA Langley Research Center — public domain (U.S. Government work)

  World Bank World Development Indicators
      World Bank — CC BY 4.0
      https://datacatalog.worldbank.org/public-licenses

The CC BY 4.0 licence above applies to the author's own work: the analysis code, the
written text, the figures and tables he produced, and the documentation. Where the frozen
data in data/raw/ is a redistribution of the sources listed above, those sources' terms
apply to it. Per-source URL, retrieval timestamp, row count and licence are recorded in
data/raw/provenance.json.
